<mxCell id="g18" value="A ping through the catalog path would rewrite 4,000 rows to move one driver. A silent driver expires after 30 s (six missed pings). A new point may trigger an enter or exit (Geofencing)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=12;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="346" width="820" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
